+      } },
+    },
+    {
+      name: 'coordination_subscribe',
+      description: 'Declare a bounded interest of this run\'s work in exact event topics ("DirectedRequestSent", "DirectedRequestResponded", "WorkParticipationEnded", "WaitConditionSatisfied"). Deliveries from now on are routed to this work. ' + principalNote + PLATFORM_EFFECT_NOTE,
